# Bulk data — regenerate via scripts/extract-*.{mjs,py} or scripts/extract-crm-sqlite.py
# These files live in public/data/ and are served as static assets at runtime.
# Do NOT move them back into scripts/ or src/ — they must stay in public/data/.
!public/data/
